WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.701 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow, thank you guys
so much, man!

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:03.536 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, yeah!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:07.340 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's good to be here.
I, uh --

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, check this out.
I was just in Denver

00:00:09.376 --> 00:00:15.382
doing some shows, and I stepped
outside to smoke some weed,

00:00:15.382 --> 00:00:19.352
and then as I'm out there,
from behind this guy goes,

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:20.487 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Hey, man!

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:22.589 line:92%
You need some sweatpants?"

00:00:22.589 --> 00:00:25.091 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:28.561
Now, he was far enough away
where that could've been

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:30.296 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
for anybody.

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:33.199 size:84% position:42%
But just in my heart,
I knew that was for me.

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:34.134 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:37.337 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's just the kind of people
that I attract.

00:00:37.337 --> 00:00:38.705 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:39.406 line:92%
You know, I said, "What?"

00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:42.409 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I wanted
to hear him yell it again.

00:00:42.409 --> 00:00:44.944 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's like, "You need
some sweatpants?"

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:47.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like, "Oh, no.
I'm good."

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:47.781 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.781 --> 00:00:50.116 align:start size:94% position:6%
He said, "Well,
how 'bout some batteries?"

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:53.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Oh, man. I can
probably use some batteries."

00:00:53.653 --> 00:00:56.423 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's a beeping
in my house I can't find.

00:00:56.423 --> 00:00:57.824 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:57.824 --> 00:00:59.959 size:78% position:39%
Now, this dude starts
coming towards me.

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:04.197
He's dragging a giant trash bag
full of stuff.

00:01:04.197 --> 00:01:06.266 line:92%
And it could all be mine!

00:01:06.266 --> 00:01:07.200 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.602 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's like, "You need
a pillowcase?"

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:11.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like, "Oh, no.
I'm good."

00:01:11.204 --> 00:01:13.506 align:start size:94% position:6%
He said, "How 'bout
an Ouija board?"

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:15.308 line:92%
"Well, you got all the pieces?"

00:01:15.308 --> 00:01:16.676 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:16.676 --> 00:01:19.412 align:start size:94% position:6%
Can't be messing around
with half a Ouija.

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:24.984 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:27.887
Now, this dude is coming
towards me and I'm, like,

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:32.659 align:start size:94% position:6%
evaluating my life like,
"Okay, well, how bad do I look

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:36.629 align:start size:94% position:6%
that this homeless dude is
trying to help me out?"

00:01:36.629 --> 00:01:39.499 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.499 --> 00:01:44.037 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:44.037 --> 00:01:48.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just trying to survive
another night on the streets.

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:49.042 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.042 --> 00:01:52.679
Then he gets right up to me
and he puts his big bag down.

00:01:52.679 --> 00:01:54.147 line:92%
And he's like, "Hey, man.

00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:56.282 line:92%
Can I get a hit of that weed?"

00:01:56.282 --> 00:01:57.183 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:57.183 --> 00:02:00.386 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like, "Oh,
okay, whatever."

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:02.655 line:92%
And then I handed him my pipe.

00:02:02.655 --> 00:02:06.860
And then he looked me up
and down and he's like --

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:11.197 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.197 --> 00:02:15.568
Just cleaning off the palsy with
his homeless sweatshirt.

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:25.612 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:29.282 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then he finally took a hit
and passed it back over to me.

00:02:29.282 --> 00:02:30.717 size:88% position:44% line:92%
And I was like, "Uh-uh."

00:02:30.717 --> 00:02:32.952 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:39.225 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:39.225 --> 00:02:42.729 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then we did that ritual,
like, nine times.

00:02:42.729 --> 00:02:43.730 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:46.266 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just got all
buddy-buddy with the guy.

00:02:46.266 --> 00:02:49.169 align:start size:94% position:6%
He was a good dude.
I just could not convince him

00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:50.937 size:84% position:42% line:92%
that I wasn't homeless.

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:51.971 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:53.473 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like, "No, man.
I'm a comedian."

00:02:53.473 --> 00:02:56.809 align:start size:94% position:6%
He said, "Oh, yeah, man.
We're all comedians."

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:59.812 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.812 --> 00:03:03.216
He said, "Oh, man.
You been really nice to me, man.

00:03:03.216 --> 00:03:05.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
I just wanna give
you something."

00:03:05.385 --> 00:03:08.288 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like, "Well,
I hope you haven't already."

00:03:08.288 --> 00:03:12.625 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.625 --> 00:03:15.528 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then, this is
where it gets weird.

00:03:15.528 --> 00:03:19.632 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:19.632 --> 00:03:22.635 align:start size:94% position:6%
He looks at me all serious.
He's like, "Hey, man.

00:03:22.635 --> 00:03:26.239 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you have some
type of brain injury?"

00:03:26.239 --> 00:03:28.708 line:92%
I was like, "Does it show?"

00:03:28.708 --> 00:03:29.943 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:29.943 --> 00:03:31.911 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then he reaches
in his pocket,

00:03:31.911 --> 00:03:34.981 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he hands me two pills.
And he's like, "Well,

00:03:34.981 --> 00:03:36.249 size:75% position:38% line:92%
these are for that."

00:03:36.249 --> 00:03:39.052 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.052 --> 00:03:41.554 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
These are for that.

00:03:41.554 --> 00:03:42.722 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:46.292 align:start size:94% position:6%
These, being two
different color pills.

00:03:46.292 --> 00:03:49.028 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:49.028 --> 00:03:50.730 size:78% position:39% line:92%
That, being my brain.

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:52.999 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.999 --> 00:03:57.337
This is from the doctor that was
trying to prescribe sweatpants.

00:03:57.337 --> 00:03:59.872 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:59.872 --> 00:04:07.013 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:07.013 --> 00:04:10.583
Now he's telling me what
kind of medication to be taking

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:12.418 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
for my brain.

00:04:12.418 --> 00:04:14.420 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then he gets all serious
with me.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:17.557 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's like, "Hey, man.
Eat 'em now!"

00:04:17.557 --> 00:04:19.892 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like, "I'm not eating
these stupid things."

00:04:19.892 --> 00:04:22.962 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, I didn't say that 'cause
that's how you get stabbed

00:04:22.962 --> 00:04:24.197 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
in the neck.

00:04:24.197 --> 00:04:24.897 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:24.897 --> 00:04:27.467 align:start size:94% position:6%
Gotta talk crazy back at 'em,
you know?

00:04:27.467 --> 00:04:29.936 align:start size:94% position:6%
I said, "Look, man.
I eat 'em later!"

00:04:29.936 --> 00:04:33.573 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:33.573 --> 00:04:34.974 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And I did.

00:04:34.974 --> 00:04:36.809 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:36.809 --> 00:04:42.815 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:42.815 --> 00:04:45.852
And I'll be damned, I could feel
that brain injury just

00:04:45.852 --> 00:04:47.487 size:75% position:38% line:92%
sloughing right off.

00:04:47.487 --> 00:04:48.755 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:48.755 --> 00:04:51.891 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the sweatpants
fit great, too.

00:04:51.891 --> 00:04:53.293 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you, guys.
You're awesome.

00:04:53.293 --> 00:04:54.193 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Thank you very much.

00:04:54.193 --> 00:04:57.563 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:57.563 --> 00:04:58.731 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
